  "notes": "Boot a Family Guy S.A.M. ROM from an empty NVRAM and enter the switch test with the named Back and Select service keys (Back, then Select five times). Hold each dedicated-switch public address 65-72 (D-1 to D-8), 81-88 (D-9 to D-16 as the driver numbers them) and -7 to -4 (D-17 to D-20) for 1.2 s with a snapshot while held and 0.8 s after release. The switch test prints the ROM's own name for a switch it reads closed. The named service keys drive the coin-door buttons 0, -1, -2 and -3, so these four are not held directly. The scenario names no game."
